ng, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-29T17:10:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T17:10:52+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161642228,"discussion_id":"44753c7fa058bcc5a7c38fd3dd456265d55b5270","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-29T17:10:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T17:10:54+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161642314,"discussion_id":"5cf3afe04237fc561d1060f7af48e1fac341ed6f","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR修复了`aclnnMoeTokenUnpermuteWithRoutingMapGetWorkspaceSize`函数在处理空张量（empty tensor）时的逻辑缺陷。具体解决了当`permutedTokens`为空且`paddedMode`为`false`时，未正确初始化所有输出张量，以及在某些情况下对空张量执行不必要的计算操作（如`Mul`和`InplaceIndexAdd`）的问题，增强了代码的鲁棒性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案主要围绕空张量处理的边界条件展开。首先，修正了空张量的判断条件，使其在`paddedMode`为`false`时也检查`permutedTokens`是否为空。其次，在识别到空张量后，通过`ZerosLike`和`ViewCopy`显式地将所有输出张量初始化为零值，确保输出状态正确。最后，在`paddedMode`为`true`的分支中，增加了对`permutedTokens`是否为空的判断，以跳过不必要的计算操作，直接使用已初始化的零张量作为结果，并添加了相应的日志。","created_at":"2026-01-29T17:11:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T17:11:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161642465,"discussion_id":"dbd5075766d64083b724f1460a5dcdc16ce5ece9","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-29T17:12:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-29T17:12:06+08:00","user":{"id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","login":"bartonfang","object_id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","name":"BartonFang","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/de/dc/99d2e56dcedde1f13b59cd88078a93c0805bb16fb62f022920d793e09307dcba.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/bartonfang"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161642468,"discussion_id":"0c3174ab3587b5aa879f33cc30c86f2736db3f8f","body":"### 代码可读性/维护性: 第233行的条件 `(paddedMode == false && permutedTokens->IsEmpty())` 意图是仅在非填充模式下且 `permutedTokens` 为空时才进行空处理。但结合后续在 `paddedMode == true` 分支中对 `permutedTokens->IsEmpty()` 的多次检查来看，代码逻辑暗示着 `permutedTokens` 为空时，无论模式如何，都应采取特殊处理（跳过乘法和索引添加）。当前的入口条件将 `paddedMode == true` 且 `permutedTokens->IsEmpty()` 的情况放入了主流程，导致代码需要在多个地方重复进行空值判断，增加了复杂性和出错风险。这种逻辑分散在多个地方，不利于维护和理解。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码可读性/维护性\n**文件路径**: `moe/moe_token_unpermute_with_routing_map/op_host/op_api/aclnn_moe_token_unpermute_with_routing_map.cpp`\n**行号**: 232\n**问题代码**:\n```cpp\n     // 空Tensor处理\n    if (sortedIndices->IsEmpty() || (paddedMode == false && permutedTokens->IsEmpty())) {\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n重新统一空值处理的逻辑。建议将所有 `permutedTokens->IsEmpty()` 的情况都在函数入口处进行统一处理。修改条件为 `if (sortedIndices->IsEmpty() || permutedTokens->IsEmpty())`。这样，代码意图更清晰：只要关键输入之一为空，就进行快速返回（用零填充输出）。这可以消除后续多个分散的 `if(!permutedTokens->IsEmpty())` 检查，简化代码流。当然，这需要确认在 `paddedMode == true` 且 `permutedTokens->IsEmpty()` 但 `sortedIndices` 非空时，输出全零是否符合算子的数学定义和调用者预期。如果符合，则此修改是合理的。\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-01-29T17:12:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-31T11:43:58+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","login":"bartonfang","object_id":"68d0fd7cb2e6f07065083dbe","name":"BartonFang","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/de/dc/99d2e56dcedde1f13b59cd88078a93c0805bb16fb62f022920d793e09307dcba.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/bartonfang"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":232,"end_new_line":232,"start_old_line":232,"end_old_line":232,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":161642669,"discussion_id":"2edbbd20d02b6386ccd09c125ac3ccbbfb771306","body":"流水线任务触发成功 [<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a494432a028df25bc3297f8&pipelineRunId=9ed1e74645f24e1caaf763bcea745d43&projectName=CANN'>9ed1e74645f24e1caaf763bcea745d43</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_a458a3ae060340d2b34d29dd7be4d813/ec4af33cda45fc0d73df84a93cf5f0ba?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/personalScandTaskInfor/person/b8d915f8-e739-40f0-a563-b69f955b76af?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>anti_vi